      "explanation": "Role 5: worklist drain. It loops while state.lateMarkedStatements is non-empty (lines 401-418), pops the head, re-runs transformTopLevelDeclaration on it, and stores the new output in lateStatementReplacementMap keyed by ast.GetNodeId(MostOriginal(next)) — re-establishing original-node identity after transforms. Because re-transforming an alias invokes role 1 -> role 3 -> role 2 -> role 4 and can enqueue further aliases, the loop only terminates at a fixed point. The final loop (422-461) walks the original statement list, keeps non-late statements, looks up each late statement's replacement by original NodeId, and applies three outcomes: missing entry -> not replaced, original kept (431-433); replacement == nil -> deleted (435-437); replacement is a KindSyntaxList -> expanded into several statements and re-checks scope/external-module markers (438-449); otherwise -> single replacement (450-458)."
